<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="At-home skincare by FMZ India. A certified woman specialist brings professional Nu Skin care to your home in Ahmedabad.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#7a2e2e">
<title>FMZ Glow | At-Home Skincare by FMZ India</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --topbar:#7a2e2e; --red:#b60a0a; --red-dark:#8f0808; --maroon:#7a2e2e; --deep:#52201f;
  --bg:#fff8f5; --blush:#fbeded; --blush-2:#faebea; --ph:#f3e5e2; --ph-line:#c9a9a6;
  --ink:#2b1514; --muted:#5e4a48; --line:#f1e0dc; --tan:#d9b48f; --white:#fff;
  --serif:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  --sans:"Montserrat",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --r:20px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:90px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;overflow-x:clip}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}
h1,h2,h3,.serif{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.wrap{width:min(1080px,calc(100% - 40px));margin-inline:auto}
.eyebrow{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--maroon);margin-bottom:14px}
.head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 44px}
.head h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4vw,2.9rem);margin-bottom:14px}
.head p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
section{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,90px) 0}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--red);background:var(--red);color:#fff;font:700 .85rem var(--sans);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--red-dark);border-color:var(--red-dark)}
.btn:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:3px}
.btn-line{background:transparent;color:var(--maroon);border-color:var(--maroon)}
.btn-line:hover{background:var(--maroon);color:#fff;border-color:var(--maroon)}
.btn-maroon{background:var(--maroon);border-color:var(--maroon)}
.btn-maroon:hover{background:var(--deep);border-color:var(--deep)}
.btn-tan{background:var(--tan);border-color:var(--tan);color:var(--deep)}
.btn-tan:hover{background:#e4c3a2;border-color:#e4c3a2}
.link{font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--red);text-decoration:none}
.link:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.ph{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ph);border:1.5px dashed var(--ph-line);border-radius:var(--r);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}

.ph img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.wa-float{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));z-index:40;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;background:#25D366;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.28);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;text-decoration:none}
.wa-float:hover{transform:scale(1.08);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.wa-float svg{width:32px;height:32px;fill:#fff}
.wa-float::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;background:#25D366;opacity:.5;z-index:-1;animation:waPulse 2.2s ease-out infinite}
@keyframes waPulse{to{transform:scale(1.6);opacity:0}}
.wa-float:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--maroon);outline-offset:3px}
/* top bar + header */
.topbar{background:var(--topbar);color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:500;padding:8px 14px}
.topbar b{font-weight:800}.topbar s{opacity:.8}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;min-height:68px}
.logo img{height:46px;width:auto}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px}
.nav-links a{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--red)}
.nav-links .btn{color:#fff;padding:11px 22px}
.nav-links .btn:hover{color:#fff}
.menu-btn{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px}
.menu-btn span{width:20px;height:2px;background:var(--maroon);border-radius:2px}
.mobile-menu{display:none;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.mobile-menu.open{display:block}
.mobile-menu a{display:block;padding:15px 22px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}

/* hero */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--blush) 0%,#fff7f4 100%);padding:70px 0 90px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:start}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,4.3rem);margin-bottom:22px;font-weight:500}
.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--maroon)}
.hero .lead{font-size:1.02rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:430px;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:22px}
.tagline{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--maroon);margin-bottom:22px}
.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:440px}
.chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600}
.hero-photo{min-height:430px;border-radius:999px 999px 20px 20px;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}
.hero-photo{border-radius:240px 240px 20px 20px}
.hero-photo span{max-width:300px}

/* concerns */
.concerns{background:var(--bg)}
.concern-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.concern{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:22px 22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.concern h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600}
.concern p{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;flex:1}
.concern.dark{background:var(--maroon);border-color:var(--maroon);color:#fff}
.concern.dark p{color:#f3dcd8}
.concern.dark .link{color:#fff}

/* how it works */
.how{background:#fff}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.step{background:var(--bg);border-radius:var(--r);padding:26px 26px 30px}
.step .n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--tan);line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px}
.step h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:0}
.step p{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0}

/* services */
.services{background:var(--bg)}
.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:stretch}
.svc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.svc.feat{border:2px solid var(--red)}
.svc .ph{border-radius:0;border:0;border-bottom:0;height:200px;font-size:.72rem}
.svc-body{padding:20px 22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.tag{align-self:flex-start;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:14px;background:var(--blush);color:var(--red)}
.tag.tan{background:var(--tan);color:var(--deep)}
.tag.dark{background:var(--maroon);color:#fff}
.svc h3{font-size:1.65rem;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600}
.svc p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}
.svc ul{margin:4px 0 18px;padding-left:18px;font-size:.8rem;flex:1}
.svc li{margin:3px 0}
.price{font-weight:800;font-size:1.7rem;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--sans)}
.price s{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}
.price small{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--red)}
.svc .btn{width:100%}
.coming{margin-top:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:24px 22px}
.coming-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px}
.coming h3{font-size:1.6rem;margin:0;font-weight:600}
.coming-top span{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted)}
.coming-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
.coming-grid div{background:var(--bg);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px}
.coming-grid b{display:block;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:4px}
.coming-grid span{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;display:block}
.fine{text-align:center;font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:820px;margin:28px auto 0}

/* plans */
.plans{background:var(--blush-2)}
.plans-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}
.plans-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-bottom:14px}
.plans-copy p{color:var(--muted)}
.plans-copy .eyebrow{margin-bottom:12px}
.plan{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:22px}
.plan.first{border:2px solid var(--maroon)}
.plan .tag{margin-bottom:12px;font-size:.58rem}
.plan h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:800;font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.25}
.plan .price{font-size:1.7rem;margin-bottom:10px}
.plan .price small{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
.plan p{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* expert */
.expert{background:var(--deep);color:#fff;padding:60px 0}
.expert-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;width:min(960px,calc(100% - 40px));margin-inline:auto}
.expert .eyebrow{color:var(--tan)}
.expert h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.7rem);margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:500}
.expert p{font-size:.85rem;color:#f3e4e0;margin:0}
.expert-cta{text-align:center}
.expert-cta .btn{width:100%;padding:16px 24px}
.expert-cta small{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:.72rem;color:#f3e4e0}

/* products */
.products{background:var(--bg)}
.sub{font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--maroon);margin:0 0 14px}
.daily{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:36px}
.prod{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:12px 12px 16px}
.prod .ph{height:100px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.66rem;padding:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.prod small{display:block;font-size:.58rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--maroon)}
.prod b{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.3;display:block;margin-top:2px}
.wellness{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:22px}
.well{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px}
.well b{display:block;font-size:.86rem;margin-bottom:4px}
.well p{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.notice{background:var(--blush-2);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.notice p{margin:0;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:520px}

/* promise */
.promise{background:#fff}
.promise-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.promise-card{background:var(--bg);border-radius:var(--r);padding:24px 22px 28px}
.promise-card h3{font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--maroon);margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600}
.promise-card p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0}

/* science */
.science{background:var(--bg)}
.sci-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}
.sci-grid .ph{min-height:300px}
.sci-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.6vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:14px}
.sci-copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:20px 0 14px}
.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px}
.stat .serif{font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--maroon);display:block;line-height:1.15;font-weight:600}
.stat span:last-child{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted)}
.sci-copy .note{font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0}

/* specialists */
.specialists{background:var(--blush-2)}
.spec-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
.spec-tag{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--maroon)}
.spec-tag::before{content:"\2713  ";color:var(--red);font-weight:700}
.spec-filter{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:30px}
.spec-filter button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:9px 20px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font:600 .78rem var(--sans);transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}
.spec-filter button:hover,.spec-filter button.active{background:var(--maroon);color:#fff;border-color:var(--maroon)}
.spec-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.spec{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.spec:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(122,46,46,.1)}
.spec-top{position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:220px;background:var(--ph);display:grid;place-items:center}
.spec-photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
}
.spec-pill{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:12px;bottom:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--maroon);font-size:.64rem;font-weight:700;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px}
.spec-body{padding:18px 18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.spec-body h3{font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.spec-qual{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:12px}
.spec-loc{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.5}
.spec-loc b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.spec-langs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:18px}
.spec-langs span{font-size:.66rem;font-weight:600;background:var(--blush);color:var(--maroon);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px}
.spec-body .btn{margin-top:auto;width:100%;padding:11px 16px;font-size:.78rem}

/* safety + reviews */
.safety{background:var(--bg)}
.safe-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px}
.safe-grid h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.4rem);margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:500}
.checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.checks div{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:700;font-size:.76rem}
.safe-note{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.review{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:14px}
.review p{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:10px}
.review b{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--maroon)}

/* booking */
.booking{background:var(--deep);color:#fff}
.book-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:50px;align-items:start}
.booking .eyebrow{color:var(--tan)}
.booking h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:14px}
.booking p {
    color: #52201f;
    font-size: .88rem;
}
.form{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:24px;padding:28px}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--red)}
.consent{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);margin:16px 0}
.consent input{width:auto;margin-top:3px;accent-color:var(--red)}
.form .btn{width:100%;padding:15px}
.form-note{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 0}
.success{display:none;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:#eaf6ea;color:#1f5d1f;font-size:.8rem}

/* faq + footer */
.faq{background:var(--bg)}
.faq-list{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto}
details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0}
summary{font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;cursor:pointer}
summary:hover{color:var(--red)}
details p{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
footer{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0}
.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot img{height:38px;width:auto}
.foot nav{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot a{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
.foot a:hover{color:var(--red)}
.foot p{margin:0;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted)}
.mobile-cta{display:none}

/* prysm scan */
.scan{background:var(--blush)}
.scan-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
.scan .eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:var(--blush-2);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 18px;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:22px}
.scan h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.6vw,3.3rem);margin-bottom:18px}
.badge-soon{display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;background:#c4985c;color:var(--deep);font:800 .72rem var(--sans);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:0;margin-left:6px}
.scan .lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:480px;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:22px}
.scan-stats{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:26px}
.scan-stat{background:var(--blush-2);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px;min-width:108px}
.scan-stat .serif{display:block;font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--maroon);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}
.scan-stat span:last-child{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted)}
.score-card{background:var(--blush-2);border-radius:28px;padding:34px 32px 28px;text-align:center}
.score-card h3{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px}
.score-num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:4rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--maroon);line-height:1}
.score-label{font-weight:800;font-size:1.05rem;margin:6px 0 18px}
.score-bands{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.score-bands i{height:14px;border-radius:999px;background:#ead5d1;display:block}
.score-bands i:nth-child(2){background:#e8c9c5}
.score-bands i:nth-child(3){background:#c27a76;height:22px}
.score-bands i:nth-child(4){background:#ddb2ae}
.score-bands i:nth-child(5){background:#d9aaa6}
.score-bands i:nth-child(6){background:#c9a2a0}
.score-track{position:relative;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#eadcd9;margin:0 4px 18px}
.score-track::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:53%;border-radius:999px;background:var(--maroon)}
.score-track::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:53%;top:50%;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--maroon);transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}
.score-card small{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* powered by nu skin */
.powered{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,70px) 0;background:var(--bg)}
.powered-box{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf1ed 0%,#fff7f4 100%);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:36px;padding:clamp(32px,5vw,56px) clamp(24px,5vw,56px)}
.powered-box::before{content:"";position:absolute;right:-60px;top:-80px;width:360px;height:360px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#f3cfc8 0%,rgba(243,207,200,0) 70%);pointer-events:none}
.powered-grid{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}
.pill-dark{display:inline-block;background:var(--maroon);color:#fff;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:22px}
.powered h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.6rem);margin-bottom:18px}
.powered .sub-i{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem);color:var(--maroon);line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:18px}
.powered .lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;max-width:470px;margin-bottom:20px}
.powered .chips{margin-bottom:26px}
.powered .chip{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:500;padding:8px 16px}
.powered .chip::before{content:"✓ ";color:var(--red);font-weight:700}
.arch-wrap{position:relative;max-width:420px;margin-inline:auto;width:100%}
.arch{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;border:6px solid #fff;border-radius:999px 999px 8px 8px;background:#5f1220;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(122,46,46,.18);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#f3dcd8;font-size:.82rem}
.arch img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}
.float-pill{position:absolute;top:12%;right:-14px;z-index:2;background:#fff;color:var(--maroon);font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
.float-card{position:absolute;left:-18px;bottom:9%;z-index:2;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.12);font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}
.float-card .serif{font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--maroon);font-weight:600}
.powered .fine{margin-top:22px;text-align:left;max-width:none}
@media(max-width:820px){
  .powered-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}
  .float-pill{right:6px}.float-card{left:6px}
}

/* scan steps */
.scan-steps{list-style:none;margin:0 0 26px;padding:0;display:grid;gap:12px;max-width:520px}
.scan-steps li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    background: #f3dbd8;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
}
.scan-steps .num{flex:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--maroon);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;display:grid;place-items:center}
.scan-steps b{display:block;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.scan-steps span.d{display:block;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}

/* devices */
.devices{background:var(--bg)}
.devices .head h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4vw,2.9rem)}
.devices .head p{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--maroon)}
.dev-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: stretch;
}
.dev-grid > * {
    height: 100%;
}
.dev{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:12px 12px 20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(122,46,46,.06)}
.dev.mid{margin-top:-14px}
.dev .ph{height:230px;border-radius:18px;border:0;margin-bottom:16px}
.dev-pill{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:12px;z-index:2;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px}
.dev-body{padding:0 8px}
.dev h3{font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.dev p{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
.dev ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.dev li{position:relative;padding-left:26px;font-size:.76rem;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:1.45}
.dev li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;top:1px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blush);color:var(--red);font-size:.58rem;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center}

/* before after */
.results{background:var(--bg)}
.results .head{text-align:left;margin-left:0;max-width:560px}
.results .head h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.4vw,3.2rem)}
.results .eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:var(--blush);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 16px;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;font-weight:500}
.ba-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px}
.ba-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden}
.ba{position:relative;height:auto;overflow:hidden;background:#f7e6df;user-select:none;touch-action:pan-y}
.ba-layer{position:relative;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:0px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}
.ba-layer img{position:relative;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.ba-after{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#fdeee6 0 22px,#f8ddd0 22px 44px)}
.ba-before{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#ead7cf 0 22px,#e1c9c0 22px 44px);clip-path:inset(0 calc(100% - var(--pos,50%)) 0 0)}
.ba-lab{position:absolute;top:14px;z-index:3;background:#5e4a48;color:#fff;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px}
.ba-lab.l{left:12px}.ba-lab.r{right:12px}
.ba-handle{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:var(--pos,50%);width:3px;background:#fff;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:3;pointer-events:none}
.ba-handle span{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--maroon)}
.ba input[type=range]{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:0;cursor:ew-resize;z-index:4;margin:0;padding:0;border:0}
.ba:focus-within .ba-handle span{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:2px}
.ba-info{padding:22px 24px 26px}
.ba-info h3{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px}
.ba-info .tag {
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: inline-block;
}
.ba-info dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr;gap:8px 12px;margin:0 0 16px;font-size:.82rem}
.ba-info dt{color:var(--muted)}
.ba-info dd{margin:0;font-weight:500}
.ba-info blockquote{margin:0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}
.results .fine{text-align:left;margin:22px 0 0;max-width:640px}

@media(max-width:960px){
  .scan-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .dev-grid,.ba-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:420px}
  .dev.mid{margin-top:0}
}
@media(max-width:960px){
  .concern-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .coming-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .plans-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.plans-copy{grid-column:1/-1}
  .daily{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .promise-grid,.spec-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .book-grid,.sci-grid,.safe-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(max-width:820px){
  .nav-links{display:none}.menu-btn{display:flex}
  .hero-grid,.expert-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}
  .hero{padding:44px 0 60px}
  .hero-photo{min-height:340px}
  .steps,.wellness{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .wrap{width:calc(100% - 32px)}
  .concern-grid,.plans-grid,.stats,.checks,.spec-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .coming-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .daily{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .form{padding:20px}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  input,select,textarea{font-size:16px}
  .actions .btn{flex:1 1 100%}
  .topbar{font-size:.66rem}
  .wa-float{right:14px;bottom:calc(78px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));width:54px;height:54px}
  .mobile-cta{display:block;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:30;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 16px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
  .mobile-cta.hide{display:none}
  .mobile-cta .btn{width:100%}
  footer{padding-bottom:calc(84px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.wa-float::before{animation:none;display:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar">Launch offer: Nu Skin LumiSpa Glow Facial <b>₹999</b> <s>₹1,199</s> · limited period · T&amp;C apply</div>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a class="logo" href="#" aria-label="FMZ Glow home"><img src="images/FMZ logo.jpg" alt="FMZ Glow" width="143" height="46"></a>
    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#skin">Your skin</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#plans">Plans</a>
      <a href="#products">Products</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <a class="btn" href="#book">Book a visit</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobileMenu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div>
  <nav class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
    <a href="#skin">Your skin</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#plans">Plans</a><a href="#products">Products</a><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#book">Book a visit</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">At-home skincare by FMZ India</div>
      <h1>Skincare that<br><em>understands</em> you.</h1>
      <p class="lead">We listen to your skin concerns first. Then a certified woman specialist brings professional Nu Skin care to your home, explains every step, and leaves you with a routine that fits your life.</p>
      <p class="tagline">Your Glow. Your Home. Your Time.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="#book">Book your glow</a>
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="#expert">Get free skin guidance</a>
      </div>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip">Women specialists only</span><span class="chip">Genuine Nu Skin products</span>
        <span class="chip">Clear prices, no pressure</span><span class="chip">Pay after your visit</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ph hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616394584738-fc6e612e71b9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Woman relaxing at home during a facial" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()"><span>Photo direction: an Indian woman relaxing at home with eyes closed, a specialist’s hands gently applying care. Soft natural light, warm tones, real skin, no heavy retouching.</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="concerns" id="skin">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">What’s on your mind?</div>
      <h2>Tell us how your skin feels</h2>
      <p>Every woman’s skin is different. Pick what sounds like you, and we’ll suggest where to start.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="concern-grid">
      <article class="concern"><h3>“My skin looks dull and tired”</h3><p>Try the Nu Skin LumiSpa Glow Facial for a fresh, bright look.</p><a class="link" href="#services">See the facial →</a></article>
      <article class="concern"><h3>“I want a gentle first step”</h3><p>Start with the FMZ Glow Cleanse: simple cleansing, hydration and advice.</p><a class="link" href="#services">See the cleanse →</a></article>
      <article class="concern"><h3>“I deserve a proper pamper”</h3><p>The Nu Skin Radiance Ritual is our most complete experience.</p><a class="link" href="#services">See the ritual →</a></article>
      <article class="concern"><h3>“I have an event coming up”</h3><p>Event-ready skincare is coming soon. Ask us what works best for now.</p><a class="link" href="#expert">Ask us →</a></article>
      <article class="concern"><h3>“I need a routine I can keep”</h3><p>Get a simple daily routine with products chosen for your skin.</p><a class="link" href="#products">Build my routine →</a></article>
      <article class="concern dark"><h3>“I’m not sure what my skin needs”</h3><p>That’s completely fine. Chat with us first, free, no obligation.</p><a class="link" href="#expert">Get guidance →</a></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
      <h2>Simple, from start to finish</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Tell us what you need</h3><p>Share your skin concern, the service you like, your pincode and a time that suits you, on WhatsApp or the form.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>We match your specialist</h3><p>We assign a certified woman specialist near you, and confirm her name, your time and the total price in writing.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Relax, then pay</h3><p>She brings everything needed. Enjoy your care, get your routine, and pay by UPI or cash afterwards.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our services</div>
      <h2>Choose your experience</h2>
      <p>Every visit starts with a conversation about your skin. Your specialist checks what suits you before she begins, and explains each step.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <!-- Package 1 -->
<article class="svc">
    <div class="ph">
        Photo: gentle cleansing at home
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570172619644-dfd03ed5d881?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
             alt="Gentle facial cleansing"
             loading="lazy"
             onerror="this.remove()">
    </div>

    <div class="svc-body">
        <span class="tag">A gentle start</span>
        <h3>FMZ Glow Cleanse</h3>

        <p>A refreshing cleansing and hydration-focused care, using approved products suited to your skin.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Skin and product suitability consultation</li>
            <li>Gentle cleansing with LumiSpa iO</li>
            <li>Helps remove daily dirt and impurities</li>
            <li>Skin feels clean, soft and refreshed</li>
            <li>Moisturising finish</li>
            <li>Simple aftercare and skincare tips</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="price">₹799</div>

        <a class="btn btn-line pkg" href="#book" data-pkg="FMZ Glow Cleanse">
            Book this service
        </a>
    </div>
</article>


<!-- Package 2 -->
<article class="svc feat">
    <div class="ph">
        Approved Nu Skin image: LumiSpa iO in use
        <img src="images/fmz-glow-facial.png"
             alt="Device-assisted facial cleansing"
             loading="lazy"
             onerror="this.remove()">
    </div>

    <div class="svc-body">
        <span class="tag tan">Signature · Launch offer</span>
        <h3>FMZ Galvanic Glow Facial</h3>

        <p>A premium facial experience using the Nu Skin Galvanic Spa device and selected skincare products.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Skin consultation and suitability check</li>
            <li>Facial treatment using the Galvanic Spa device</li>
            <li>Uses selected Nu Skin skincare products</li>
            <li>Helps skin feel soft and smooth</li>
            <li>Leaves skin feeling refreshed and nourished</li>
            <li>Moisturising finish and home-care tips</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="price">
            ₹999 <s>₹1,199</s> <small>launch price</small>
        </div>

        <a class="btn pkg" href="#book" data-pkg="Nu Skin Galvanic Glow Facial">
            Book this service
        </a>
    </div>
</article>


<!-- Package 3 -->
<article class="svc">
    <div class="ph">
        Approved Nu Skin image: Prysm iO experience
        <img src="images/fmz-radiance-ritual.png"
             alt="Premium facial skincare ritual"
             loading="lazy"
             onerror="this.remove()">
    </div>

    <div class="svc-body">
        <span class="tag dark">Premium</span>
        <h3>FMZ Prysm iO Radiance Ritual</h3>

        <p>A personalised wellness experience combining a quick skin antioxidant scan with tailored skincare and wellness guidance.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Extended personal consultation</li>
            <li>Quick 15-second finger scan</li>
            <li>Get your personal Prysm Score</li>
            <li>Understand your skin's antioxidant level</li>
            <li>Track changes in your score over time</li>
            <li>Personalised wellness and skincare guidance</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="price">₹1,699</div>

        <a class="btn btn-line pkg" href="#book" data-pkg="Nu Skin Prysm iO Radiance Ritual">
            Book this service
        </a>
    </div>
</article>
    </div>

    <div class="coming">
      <div class="coming-top"><h3>Coming soon</h3><span>Opening as our specialists complete training for each one</span></div>
      <div class="coming-grid">
        <div><b>Glow Facial + Prysm iO Wellness Insight</b><span>Your Glow Facial plus a skin carotenoid reading, explained</span></div>
        <div><b>Basic cleanup</b><span>A quick refresh between facials</span></div>
        <div><b>Hydration-focused facial</b><span>For skin that feels dry or tight</span></div>
        <div><b>Event-ready skincare</b><span>Prepare your skin before a special day</span></div>
        <div><b>Hand and foot care add-on</b><span>Add to any facial visit</span></div>
      </div>
      <a class="link" href="#expert">Tell me when these launch →</a>
    </div>
 
  </div>
</section>

<section class="plans" id="plans">
  <div class="wrap plans-grid">
    <div class="plans-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Glow plans</div>
      <h2>Beautiful skin is a habit, not a one-off</h2>
      <p>Regular care with the same trusted specialist keeps your routine on track. Plans save you money and keep your next visit booked.</p>
    </div>
    <article class="plan first">
      <span class="tag tan">First plan</span>
      <h3>Glow 3-Visit Plan</h3>
      <div class="price">₹3,299 <small>₹1,100 per visit</small></div>
      <p>Three LumiSpa Glow Facials, spaced to suit your skin. Valid 90 days. Save ₹298.</p>
      <a class="link" href="#book">Ask about this plan →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="plan">
      <span class="tag" style="background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)">Coming soon</span>
      <h3>Memberships and family plans</h3>
      <p>Six-visit memberships, monthly plans and bundles for mothers, daughters and friends.</p>
      <a class="link" href="#expert">Notify me →</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>



<section class="expert" id="expert">
  <div class="expert-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Expert guidance</div>
      <h2>Not sure where to start? Just ask us.</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your skin on WhatsApp. A trained FMZ Glow expert will suggest the right service or routine for you. Free, private and no pressure to book.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="expert-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-tan" href="https://wa.me/+917303706047?text=Hi%20FMZ%20Glow%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20know%20more%20about%20your%20at-home%20skincare%20services." rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
  
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="scan" id="scan">
  <div class="wrap scan-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Antioxidant scan by Prysm iO</div>
      <h2>Know your antioxidant level in 15 seconds </h2>
      <p class="lead">A quick, painless finger scan measures antioxidant levels in your skin, an indicator of your nutritional wellness. Your specialist explains your score and simple food tips.</p>
     
      <ol class="scan-steps">
        <li><span class="num">1</span><div><b>Place your fingertip</b><span class="d">No needles and no discomfort.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="num">2</span><div><b>Hold for 15 seconds</b><span class="d">The device scans using light.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="num">3</span><div><b>Get your score explained</b><span class="d">Your specialist shares simple food and routine tips.</span></div></li>
      </ol>
      <a class="btn btn-maroon" href="#expert">Tell me when it launches</a>
    </div>
    <div class="score-card" aria-label="Sample Prysm Score">
      <h3>What your score means</h3>
      <div class="score-num">320</div>
      <div class="score-label">Moderate</div>
      <div class="score-bands" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <div class="score-track" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <small>Sample only. Higher is better.</small>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="products" id="products">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Continue your glow at home</div>
      <h2>Products chosen for your skin</h2>
      <p>Your specialist recommends a simple routine from the Nu Skin range and shows you how to use it. Order through your specialist and get her guidance with every product.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="sub">Daily skincare</p>
    <div class="daily">
      <div class="prod"><div class="ph">Product photo<img src="images/glow.png" data-fb="images/glow.png" alt="Face Wash" loading="lazy" onerror="var f=this.dataset.fb;if(f){this.removeAttribute('data-fb');this.src=f}else{this.remove()}"></div><small>CLEANSE</small><b>Face Wash</b></div>
