<section class="booking" id="book">
  <div class="wrap book-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Book a visit</div>
      <h2>Ready for your glow?</h2>
      <p>Send us your details and preferred service. Our team will contact you on WhatsApp to confirm your specialist, time and total price in writing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form">
      <!-- DEMO FORM: connect to your WordPress/Elementor form, CRM or WhatsApp workflow before launch. -->
  
<form id="bookForm" action="send-booking.php" method="POST">

    <div class="form-grid">

        <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input
                id="name"
                name="name"
                type="text"
                autocomplete="name"
                required
            >
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label for="phone">WhatsApp number</label>
            <input
                id="phone"
                name="phone"
                type="tel"
                autocomplete="tel"
                placeholder="+91"
                required
                pattern="[0-9+\s()-]{8,18}"
            >
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label for="pin">Pincode</label>
            <input
                id="pin"
                name="pin"
                inputmode="numeric"
                required
                pattern="[0-9]{6}"
                maxlength="6"
            >
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label for="service">Service</label>
            <select id="service" name="service" required>
                <option>FMZ Glow Cleanse</option>
                <option selected>Nu Skin LumiSpa Glow Facial</option>
                <option>Nu Skin Radiance Ritual</option>
                <option>Glow 3-Visit Plan</option>
                <option>Not sure, help me choose</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label for="date">Preferred date</label>
            <input id="date" name="date" type="date">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
            <label for="time">Preferred time</label>
            <select id="time" name="time">
                <option value="">No preference</option>
                <option>Morning</option>
                <option>Afternoon</option>
                <option>Evening</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field full">
            <label for="msg">Your skin concern (optional)</label>
            <textarea id="msg" name="msg" rows="3"></textarea>
        </div>

    </div>

    <label class="consent" for="consent">
        <input
            id="consent"
            name="consent"
            type="checkbox"
            value="yes"
            required
        >
        <span>
            I agree that FMZ India may contact me on WhatsApp about this request.
        </span>
    </label>

    <button class="btn" id="bookingSubmit" type="submit">
        Book your glow
    </button>

    <p class="form-note">
        This request does not confirm an appointment. Price, specialist and
        any travel charges are confirmed in writing before your visit.
        You pay after your visit.
    </p>

    <!-- Success / Error message -->
    <div
        class="success"
        id="ok"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
        style="display:none;"
    ></div>

</form>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details><summary>Is the facial suitable for my skin type?</summary><p>Our services are personalised to your skin's needs. Before beginning, your specialist will discuss your skin concerns and check whether the selected products and treatment are suitable for you.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I get a facial if I have sensitive skin or acne?</summary><p>Please tell us about any sensitivity, acne, allergies or ongoing skin concerns when booking. Your specialist will assess product suitability, and we may recommend postponing the service or consulting a dermatologist.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I get a facial during pregnancy or while breastfeeding?</summary><p>Some skincare products and device treatments may not be suitable during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Please inform us when booking so we can discuss appropriate options and any necessary medical advice.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will I experience redness, irritation or breakouts after the facial?</summary><p>Skin reactions vary from person to person. Although we use products according to their instructions and check suitability beforehand, temporary redness or irritation may occur. Please contact us if you experience a persistent or unexpected reaction.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does a facial appointment take?</summary><p>Appointment duration depends on the service selected. We will confirm the expected duration when your booking is confirmed.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What do I need to prepare before the specialist arrives?</summary><p>Just a comfortable, well-lit space where you can relax. Your specialist brings the products, devices and essentials required for your booked service.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will the same specialist visit me every time?</summary><p>We will do our best to assign your preferred specialist for repeat visits, subject to availability.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I book a facial for my mother, friend or family member?</summary><p>Yes. You can enquire about booking a service for someone else. Please share their skin concerns and preferred appointment details with us in advance.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I have to purchase Nu Skin products after my facial?</summary><p>No. Product purchases are entirely optional. Your specialist will explain your skincare options, but there is no obligation to buy anything.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are there any additional or travel charges?</summary><p>Any applicable travel charges or additional costs will be communicated to you in writing before your appointment is confirmed.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I use my own skincare products during the facial?</summary><p>Our services are designed around selected Nu Skin products and approved device protocols. Please let us know if you have a preferred product or ingredient concern before your appointment.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How soon will I see results, and how long will they last?</summary><p>Results vary depending on your skin, the service and your home-care routine. Some people notice an immediate refreshed feeling, while longer-term cosmetic improvements may require consistent care. We cannot guarantee specific results.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is the difference between LumiSpa iO and Galvanic Spa?</summary><p>LumiSpa iO is used for device-assisted cleansing, while Galvanic Spa uses microcurrent technology as part of selected skincare treatments. Your specialist can explain which service is appropriate for your needs.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the Prysm iO scan a medical test?</summary><p>No. Prysm iO provides a cosmetic wellness-related antioxidant score. It is not a medical test, does not diagnose disease and should not replace medical advice.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will I receive a personalised skincare routine after my visit?</summary><p>Yes. Your specialist will share practical skincare guidance and explain how to use recommended products at home. Purchasing those products is optional.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

